---
import SectionInfo from "../../components/SectionInfo.astro";
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import suppliers from "../../json/suppliers.json";
import Footer from "../../components/Footer.astro";
import { LinkServices } from "../../data/LinkServicesRoffing";
import MoreServices from "../../components/moreServices.astro";
import RelationServices from "../../components/relationServices.astro";
import TrustOur from "../../components/trustOur.astro";
import CertificatesAffiliations from "../../components/CertificatesAffiliations.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Roof Installation in Albany | Trusted Roofing Contractors - Nova Solutions"
  description="Looking for expert roof installation in Albany? Nova Solutions delivers top-quality roofing with premium materials, expert craftsmanship, and exceptional service."
/>

  <SectionInfo heading={"Roof Installation​"} sliders={suppliers} />


<div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 my-16">
  <div
    class="text-sm text-gray-600 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center lg:justify-start mb-6"
  >
    <a href="/" class="hover:text-primary">Home</a>
    <iconify-icon
      icon="mingcute:arrows-right-line"
      class="mx-2 text-gray-400 text-lg"></iconify-icon>
    <a href="/Roofing" class="font-semibold hover:text-primary">Roofing</a>
    <iconify-icon
      icon="mingcute:arrows-right-line"
      class="mx-2 text-gray-400 text-lg"></iconify-icon>
    <span class="font-semibold text-black">Installation Roofing</span>
  </div>

  <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-10 items-center lg:items-start">
    <div class="flex-1 space-y-6">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-black text-center lg:text-left">
        Top-Rated Roof Installation Team in Albany
      </h1>

      <p class="text-black mt-4 leading-relaxed text-justify">
        Your roof may be out of sight and out of mind, but that doesn’t mean
        it’s not working hard to <strong
          >protect your home from severe weather and extreme temperatures</strong
        >. A high-quality roof not only shields your house, but also boosts its
        value and adds essential <strong>structural support</strong>.
      </p>

      <p class="text-black mt-4 leading-relaxed text-justify">
        At <strong>Nova Solutions</strong>, we believe this vital part of your
        home deserves expert care. That’s why we’re proud to be one of the <strong
          >top-rated roofing companies in Albany</strong
        >. Our team of trained professionals is ready to install or replace your
        roof using <strong>premium materials and precision workmanship</strong>.
      </p>

      <p class="text-gray-700 mt-4 leading-relaxed text-justify">
        With years of hands-on experience in the Albany area, our roofing
        installers know exactly what it takes to deliver roofs that stand the
        test of time. Each project is completed <strong
          >on time, on budget, and with complete customer satisfaction</strong
        >. Don’t just take our word for it—read our <a
          href="/reviews"
          class="text-black hover:underline font-bold">5-star reviews</a
        > to see why homeowners trust <strong>Nova Solutions</strong>.
      </p>
    </div>
    <section class="flex-1 text-black">
      <CertificatesAffiliations />
    </section>
  </div>
</div>

<section
  class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 my-16 grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 items-center"
>
  <div class="space-y-4">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-black mt-10">
      Trusted Roof Installation in Albany with Nova Solutions
    </h2>

    <p class="text-black mt-4 leading-relaxed text-justify">
      At <strong>Nova Solutions</strong>, our Albany roofing installers combine
      expert craftsmanship with stylish, long-lasting materials to give your
      home a roof that’s both <strong>durable and beautiful</strong>. We partner
      with <strong>nationally recognized manufacturers</strong> to ensure your new
      roof is made from <strong
        >weather-resistant, fire-resistant, and cost-effective shingles</strong
      >.
    </p>

    <p class="text-black mt-4 leading-relaxed text-justify">
      While shingles are key, it’s the <strong>quality of installation</strong> that
      truly makes your roof last. Our team is fully trained and brings years of experience
      working on all types of residential roofs — no matter the size, slope, or design.
      We pay close attention to detail, placing every shingle with care to <strong
        >maximize protection and minimize the risk of future leaks</strong
      >.
    </p>

    <p class="text-black mt-4 leading-relaxed text-justify">
      Whether you're building new or replacing an aging roof, trust <strong
        >Nova Solutions</strong
      > as your go-to roofing contractor in Albany. We're here to protect your home
      and bring you peace of mind.
    </p>
  </div>
  <img
    src="https://res.cloudinary.com/driyxelzh/image/upload/v1746999486/Imagen_de_WhatsApp_2025-05-11_a_las_17.32.00_25c2ee27_smwlh3.jpg"
    alt="Roofing Installation"
    class="rounded-xl shadow-lg w-full max-w-md mx-auto"
  />
</section>

<!-- Sección 2: Imagen a la izquierda + texto -->
<section
  class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 my-16 grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 items-center"
>
  <img
    src="https://res.cloudinary.com/driyxelzh/image/upload/v1745296100/GAF-Layer-lock-Dynamic-Restoration_hodwla.jpg"
    alt="Certified Roofing Process"
    class="rounded-xl shadow-lg w-full max-w-md mx-auto order-1 md:order-none"
  />
  <div class="space-y-4">
    <section class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 my-16">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-black mt-10">
        What to Expect from Our Expert Albany Roofing Installers
      </h2>

      <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-black mt-4 space-y-2">
        <li>
          <strong>Safety First:</strong> Our roofs are built with resilience in mind
          — designed to withstand wind, fire, and structural stress.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Leak-Resistant Installation:</strong> We use precise techniques
          to install shingles that prevent leaks and drafts in any weather.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Stylish Options:</strong> Choose from a wide selection of colors,
          textures, and materials to match your home’s aesthetic.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Energy Efficiency:</strong> Our roofing systems help insulate your
          home from temperature swings, reducing energy costs year-round.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Long-Lasting Durability:</strong> We only use high-grade shingles
          that hold up against storms, hail, high winds, and even fire.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Outstanding Customer Service:</strong> We care about your satisfaction
          just as much as your roof — and it shows in every project.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <p class="text-black mt-6 leading-relaxed">
        Have questions for our Albany roofing experts? <a
          href="/About/Contact-us"
          class="text-black hover:underline font-bold">Contact Nova Solutions</a
        > today to speak with a knowledgeable team member and schedule your roofing
        consultation.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</section>
<section
  class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 my-16 grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 items-center"
>
  <div class="space-y-4">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-black mt-10">
      Why Partner With Our Roofing Installers?
    </h2>

    <p class="text-black mt-4 leading-relaxed text-justify">
      When it comes to your home, you deserve the best. That’s why we’re proud
      Your roof is one of the most important parts of your home — protecting
      everything inside from storms, heat, and harsh weather conditions. When it
      comes to something this essential, you deserve peace of mind knowing it’s
      being installed by a trusted team of Greater Albany roofing contractors.
    </p>

    <p class="text-black mt-4 leading-relaxed text-justify">
      At <strong>Nova Solutions</strong>, we bring years of experience, advanced
      roofing knowledge, and outstanding customer service to every project.
      Whether you need a full roof replacement or a quick repair, our team
      ensures a smooth process from beginning to end.
    </p>

    <p class="text-black mt-4 leading-relaxed text-justify">
      Ready to work with Greater Albany trusted roofing installers? <a
        href="/About/Contact-us"
        class="text-black hover:underline font-bold">Call us today</a
      > or fill out our quick online form. We’re here to answer your questions and
      provide a free, no-obligation roofing estimate!
    </p>
  </div>
  <img
    src="https://res.cloudinary.com/driyxelzh/image/upload/v1746999979/Captura_de_pantalla_2025-05-11_174601_pm9ef8.png"
    alt="Roofing Installation"
    class="rounded-xl shadow-lg w-full max-w-lg mx-auto h-85"
  />
</section>

<TrustOur />

<RelationServices title="Related Roofing Services" services={LinkServices} />
<MoreServices />

<Footer />
